	<H3>Plane Signup</H3>
	<P>Welcome to the plane raid signup page of the Lost Souls of Glaznor. If you are a member of the Souls you can sign
	up here for the next plane raid. The raid is generally limited to members only and in some special cases invited
	guests. If you are not invited you can signup but your chance to be allowed to the raid is very low.
	<P>The maximum amount of players who can go to a plane raid is 24. Members should allways signup even there are allready
	more members on the list. We will try to allways even include members beyond the maximum but we cannot promise that.

	<H3>Rules and Strategie</H3>
	<P>The rules of the plane raids can be found at our webpage also with a guide how we do the planes. Please go to the event
	section where the events are announced and check for informations there. Groups will be set up arround one day before the
	raid and send to everyone on the signup list by email. Make sure you check your mail in time to know the groups and
	additional informations.

	<H3>Contact</H3>
	<P>Feel free to contact Utrellien, Ratinga or Siglo in game if you have a question or send a mail to utrellien@dland.de
	(Utrellien) or eq@dland.de (Ratinga). We will try to answer all =)
	<P>Good luck.
</DIV>

